OL,3,AOpenAI says teen ChatGPT use limited
OL,4,Abut research finds it an 'unacceptable
OL,5,Arisk'
OL,6,
OL,7,FHowever, research released the same day
OL,8,Ffrom non-profit Common Sense Media
OL,9,Ffound that ChatGPT still poses an
OL,10,F"unacceptable risk" for teens as safety
OL,11,Ffeatures, including notifying parents
OL,12,Fof self-harm conversations, often fail.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
